{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2e3b56a2a6948fa6ee8955a867c82528e99bf5a83e5f613884aabaf9019086c1", "ja": "（昴の新しい衣装が届いた。今回は\nロックがテーマの衣装となっているが……）", "zh": "（昴的新服装送到了。这次的服装主题是摇滚，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "c6c221149856794e55363fd799d4ad2842f01282045f735da787d3ea5c34e4da", "ja": "ううっ、まただよ……。亜利沙って、\nなんで気を抜いてる時に限って、近くにいるんだ……？", "zh": "呜呜，又来了……。亚利沙这家伙，\n为什么偏偏在我放松警惕的时候，刚好在旁边啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7a8ca8bfb24bb18c50efa89642af0a71ce479cac8baaa1e051c6bcc6c322360f", "ja": "昴、お疲れさま。\n……亜利沙がどうかしたのか？", "zh": "昴，辛苦了。\n……亚利沙怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "a1e8b9bc1f10207f490e6b1c87088a4a8908ee0e48a933c1427f90f12be7000f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　聞いてくれよ！\nさっき、亜利沙に写真撮られたんだよ～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！听我说！\n刚才亜利沙给我拍照了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "1cef21c79d4d09c00676ee3c7ab921a9b353c96675be024457ca5ff4357f04e3", "ja": "別に撮るのはいいんだけど。\n油断してる時に撮るのは、やめて欲しくてさ～。", "zh": "拍照倒是没什么。\n只是希望她别在人放松警惕的时候拍啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3fb32bce8363838754f0fdb2216ddcb77554279cfc3730d512e36cd8e41adf9b", "ja": "なるほどな……。あとで亜利沙と話してみるよ。\nでも、何か油断することでもあったのか？", "zh": "原来如此……我之后会找亚利沙谈谈的。\n不过，是发生了什么让你放松警惕的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "90f3817b8738c5626d295ff890b16f6d32c006e9c3cb7b1ae32a81a2db8298ad", "ja": "えっ？　えっと……。\nその、今回の衣装、すげー良かったからさ。", "zh": "诶？那个……  \n就是，这次的服装特别棒，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "b258bdb0cb974bce95059ff7518bec2a917a0eb391d5f927213730f6ad1c11fc", "ja": "仕事のために、いろいろ研究してみようかなって。\nオレなりに、色々試してたんだよ。", "zh": "我想为了工作，研究一下各种不同的东西。\n我也按照自己的方式，尝试了各种各样的做法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "64fabb686378f43ce3cb740163f8912c0eab019d3289ec606be1d201a629d30e", "ja": "鏡の前でポーズとったりしてたら、パシャって……。\nあの時のオレ、ぜってーハズい顔してたよ～。", "zh": "我在镜子前摆姿势的时候，突然“咔嚓”一声……那时候的我，表情绝对超级丢脸～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "98e60e98e64ba4ab40ab6a3884e4af331641c9abbefa9e99405b3233dd84028b", "ja": "そうか。研究を……。亜利沙は、その時の昴が可愛いと\n思ったんだな。思わず撮りたくなるくらいに。", "zh": "原来如此。研究啊……亚利沙觉得那时候的昴很可爱呢。可爱到让人忍不住想拍下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "7098c5347dc3f752b84f5fe9278e7af0b992da4849ee2b48e3ae55f0095c002e", "ja": "えっ、かわいい！？　うー……ダメダメ！\n{$P$}まで、からかうなよなー！", "zh": "诶，可爱！？呜……不行不行！连{$P$}也别来逗我啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "1c46180459c8079ce8cf032335d5ed6bb82b30d781aebe1269ca7803671a5179", "ja": "ロックな衣装なんだから、カッコよくないと！\nかわいいって思われたら、むしろ負けって感じじゃん！", "zh": "既然是摇滚风的服装，就得帅气才行！\n要是被觉得可爱，反倒感觉像输了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2f1cac2fb0209b1d0ac0196f90c77a448c1bb16e3111105f71196722542a07e5", "ja": "そんなことはないんじゃないか？\n逆にギャップになっていいと思うけど。", "zh": "我觉得不一定吧？\n反差一下不是也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "affc4b6084084cc3a6fb73b2af6488ed2a6f0e1d9f031bdfd20b05c16e70ec27", "ja": "ギャップ……？　カッコいいとかわいいで？\nそういうのもあるの、か？", "zh": "反差……？帅气和可爱之间的反差？\n还有这种说法的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f6ccea09288bcd161f7d0462a003c9fa36e9e4c65fff92d1133147c177563f3a", "ja": "ああ。その衣装だって、カッコいい部分もあれば、\n可愛い部分もあるだろう？", "zh": "啊。这套服装也是，既有帅气的一面，\n也有可爱的一面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "58d363b564fff885c45ba0cc1e5879f5eda1e0ca28675ff911e639ead1483388", "ja": "この衣装も……。たしかに、そうだな。\nカッコいいとかわいい……あ、わかった！", "zh": "这套服装也是……确实，是这样。  \n帅气和可爱……啊，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "f23238d3aaf5fb8d02283eb63c61a6dcd28d67bf1aead5ea3338663c55efbea8", "ja": "かわいいアイドルが、急にカッコいい演技すると、\nすっげードキっとする！　……みたいな？", "zh": "可爱的偶像突然演起帅气的戏来，真的会让人心头一跳！……大概就是这种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "84613c659ed47919503965afb3c94de8a865a4535d9f5cea66c3b10e5a594297", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。ファンの人達も、カッコいいだけじゃ\nない……色んな昴をみられたら嬉しいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。粉丝们要是能看到不只是帅气的……各种各样的昴，应该也会很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "4e50a6b431dea09fcb932b543174413164b1a84f87205b700a275109bcdba913", "ja": "なるほどな～……。ロックだからって、\nカッコよければいいってわけじゃないんだな。", "zh": "原来如此～……。摇滚也不是只要帅气就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "ee8e7ad7e9c61a7a851e4c1efc3a0ba8a6ba9bb6ced6b12c0ce5f87fc229a8c8", "ja": "{$P$}、サンキュな！\nおかげで、いいことに気づけたよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢啦！多亏了你，我才意识到一件很棒的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "6a14636e87427088a8ef4fa247c35f7d47b402ac15f31644e8459dea143ee5a8", "ja": "亜利沙のやつも、たまにはいいことするな！\n今度、何枚か撮らせてやってもいいかもな♪", "zh": "亚利沙那家伙偶尔也会做件好事嘛！下次，说不定可以让她拍几张♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0334_1021_p", "source_sha256": "869f207848eb3f0d809bf1e8fea4ed37159451312f62a6633fd4e8f1a8a5e01c", "ja": "（昴の様々な魅力を引き出す、最高の衣装になったな。\n……それじゃ、亜利沙と話をしに行かないとな！）", "zh": "（这套服装很棒，能展现昴各种各样的魅力。\n……那么，得去和亚利沙聊聊才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
